            "border_color": "",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "The Solution",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<p>Flow ingested Daytona's existing storefront RTSP camera feeds. Our edge-AI engine automatically isolated and subtracted employee operational routines. By scrubbing this \"data noise,\" Daytona achieved a 100% honest baseline of pure customer behavior for the first time.</p>",
